// M5-A3P-1014. Ending E1 "Imra" (C, 2.5 min). GOODBYE: IMRA. act3_ending.md §2 E1, §0 rules 1, 3, 7, 8.
// On the Kite's dark deck. Imra, free of the heart, kneels in front of Asha. HANDS AND SILENCE: two lines at most, both
// Imra's. She hums the first phrase of the Velamir lullaby (N-11) once, for her daughter. ASHA DOESN'T TRY TO JOIN HER
// (the failed song is E5's and must not be spent here). A tight two-shot, mostly hands; Imra lit by her own lift, Asha by
// her mother's; hold on their joined hands after Imra's light has gone out of them. FRAMING: Dace and Kerrid out of
// frame. Score drops out; Imra's unaccompanied hum is the cue; one piano note only after she is gone.
// sea_glow 0.15 (§0 rule 4: Rendering's curve, not a cue). Everything rises; nothing is held (rule 7).
title: ending_imra
location: ch18/kite
---
@letterbox on
@camera E01
@music silence fade=1.0
@anim imra kneel asha
@vfx glimmer_lift at=imra count=30 motion=spiral_up rate=slow
@wait 4.0
Imra [tender]: There you are. #line:ending_imra_001
@wait 3.0
@anim imra take_hands asha
@sfx velamir_lullaby_hum at=imra vol=0.7
@wait 12.0
Imra [soft_smile]: You let me go right. #line:ending_imra_002
@wait 3.0
@camera E02
@vfx glimmer_lift at=imra count=60 motion=spiral_up rate=slow
@wait 6.0
@music goodbye_imra fade=0.0
@wait 4.0
@letterbox off
===
